  "ruleText": "Lan 304.03 Replacement Fee. The fee for replacement of a lost or mutilated certificate of licensure shall be $30.00.\n\nSource. #5934, eff 12-9-94; ss by #6929-B, 1-12-99, EXPIRED: 1-12-07\n\nNew. #8806, INTERIM, eff 1-23-07, EXPIRED: 7-22-07\n\nNew. #8960, eff 8-9-07; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
